00:31:55,300 --> 00:32:00,300
So it seems wasteful, but it actually turns out to be more efficient

329
00:32:00,300 --> 00:32:03,300
if they're fairly simple computations.

330
00:32:03,300 --> 00:32:05,300
And the reason of that is,

331
00:32:05,300 --> 00:32:09,300
and we'll see a little bit more when we talk about performance optimization.

